|                           | 📚 RAG               | 🤖 AI Agent         | 🧠 Agentic AI                 | 🔌 MCP                     |
| ------------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------- |
| **What is it?**           | Knowledge technique  | AI worker           | Autonomous AI system          | Connection standard        |
| **Main job**              | Find information     | Perform a task      | Achieve a goal                | Connect AI to tools/data   |
| **Can make decisions?**   | Limited              | Yes, to some extent | **Yes, autonomously**         | No                         |
| **Can use tools?**        | Not necessarily      | **Yes**             | **Yes, multiple tools**       | Provides access to tools   |
| **Uses external data?**   | **Yes**              | Sometimes           | Sometimes                     | **Can expose data/tools**  |
| **Plans multiple steps?** | No                   | Sometimes           | **Yes**                       | No                         |
| **Example**               | Search PDFs → answer | Analyze CSV         | Complete forecasting workflow | Connect AI to database/API |
| **Think of it as**        | 📖 Knowledge         | 👨‍🔧 Worker        | 👨‍💼 Manager/team            | 🔌 Connector               |


==============

Very simple example

Suppose you build a Customer Support AI:

RAG

"Search the company's FAQ/PDF and answer the customer's question."

AI Agent

"Check the customer's order and give the delivery status."

Agentic AI

"Handle the customer's complaint completely: understand → check order → investigate → decide → take action → verify → respond."

MCP

"Provide a standard connection so the AI can access the order database, CRM, files, or other tools."

=========


The relationship


                    AGENTIC AI
                        │
             ┌──────────┴──────────┐
             ↓                     ↓
         AI AGENTS              Planning
             │
       ┌─────┴─────┐
       ↓           ↓
      RAG         MCP
   Knowledge    Tool/Data
   retrieval    connection

===========

“RAG gives AI the right knowledge, an AI Agent performs tasks, Agentic AI autonomously plans and completes complex goals,
and MCP provides a standardized connection between AI and external tools or data.”

============

RAG → could provide forecasting documentation/knowledge
AI Agents → Data Agent, EDA Agent, Model Selection Agent, Forecasting Agent, etc.
Agentic AI → coordinates those agents to complete the forecasting goal autonomously
MCP → could connect the system to external databases, files, APIs, or business tools.

============
